  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 103.52 “Ordinary high water mark” means “ordinary high water mark” as defined in RSA 483-B:4, XI-e, reprinted in Appendix C.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 103.50)",
